-- --- XIAOMI FLAGSHIPS (8 products) ---
('xiaomi-15-ultra-16gb-1tb', 'Xiaomi 15 Ultra 16GB RAM 1TB', 'smartphones', 2500000, 2500000, 2050000, 6, 0.23, '/assets/products/xiaomi-15-ultra-16gb-1tb.jpg', 'The Xiaomi 15 Ultra is the ultimate expression of smartphone photography, co-engineered with Leica. The quad-camera system features a 1-inch 50MP Sony LYT-900 main sensor with variable aperture (f/1.63-f/4.0), a 200MP periscope telephoto with 4.3x optical and up to 100x AI-enhanced zoom, a 50MP floating telephoto for macro (10cm), and a 50MP ultra-wide. Leica Authentic and Leica Vibrant color profiles, Master Portrait mode with four classic Leica bokeh effects, and 8K Dolby Vision HDR video recording make this a filmmaker''s dream. The 6.73-inch WQHD+ LTPO AMOLED display with 1-120Hz adaptive refresh and 3200 nits peak brightness is stunning. Snapdragon 8 Elite processor, 16GB RAM, 1TB UFS 4.0 storage, 5000mAh battery with 90W wired HyperCharge (0-100% in 33 minutes), 80W wireless, and 20W reverse wireless charging. Xiaomi HyperOS 2, titanium frame option, and IP68 complete this Leica-engineered masterpiece.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2050000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-15-ultra-16gb-1tb.jpg', 2255000, 4.8, 1, 'Xiaomi', 1, 1),

('xiaomi-15-pro-12gb-512gb', 'Xiaomi 15 Pro 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 1650000, 1650000, 1350000, 10, 0.22, '/assets/products/xiaomi-15-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'Xiaomi 15 Pro combines flagship performance with Leica optics. The 6.73-inch WQHD+ LTPO AMOLED display with 120Hz adaptive refresh and 3200 nits brightness delivers exceptional visuals. Snapdragon 8 Elite with 12GB RAM powers through demanding applications. The Leica triple camera system features a 50MP Light Fusion 900 main sensor with f/1.44 aperture, 50MP Leica floating telephoto (3.2x optical, 10cm macro), and 50MP ultra-wide. Leica Summilux optical lens, Master Portrait modes, and 8K video. 5000mAh battery with 90W wired and 50W wireless charging. HyperOS 2 with AI features, IP68, and premium glass/aluminum build.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1350000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-15-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 1485000, 4.7, 1, 'Xiaomi', 1, 1),

('xiaomi-14t-pro-12gb-512gb', 'Xiaomi 14T Pro 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 850000, 850000, 695000, 12, 0.21, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14t-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'Xiaomi 14T Pro brings Leica professional optics to an accessible price. MediaTek Dimensity 9300+ processor with 12GB RAM delivers flagship performance. 6.67-inch 1.5K AMOLED display with 144Hz refresh and 4000 nits peak brightness. Leica triple camera: 50MP Light Fusion 900 main with OIS, 50MP telephoto (2.6x optical), and 12MP ultra-wide. Leica filters, Master Portrait, and 4K 60fps HDR video. 5000mAh battery with 120W HyperCharge (0-100% in 19 minutes) and 50W wireless. IP68, HyperOS, and AI features including circle-to-search.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 695000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14t-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 764500, 4.6, 0, 'Xiaomi', 1, 0),

('xiaomi-14t-12gb-256gb', 'Xiaomi 14T 12GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 650000, 650000, 530000, 18, 0.20, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14t-12gb-256gb.jpg', 'Xiaomi 14T delivers Leica imaging and premium performance. MediaTek Dimensity 8300 Ultra with 12GB RAM, 6.67-inch 1.5K AMOLED 144Hz display with 4000 nits. Leica 50MP main with OIS, 50MP telephoto (2x optical), and 12MP ultra-wide. Leica filters and portrait modes. 5000mAh battery with 67W turbo charging. IP68, HyperOS, and sleek design.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 530000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-14t-12gb-256gb.jpg', 583000, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1),

-- --- REDMI SERIES (10 products) ---
('redmi-note-15-pro-plus-12gb-512gb', 'Redmi Note 15 Pro Plus 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 480000, 480000, 392000, 20, 0.21, '/assets/products/redmi-note-15-pro-plus-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'The Redmi Note 15 Pro Plus dominates the mid-range with flagship-level features. The 6.67-inch 1.5K AMOLED display with 120Hz adaptive refresh, 1800 nits brightness, and Gorilla Glass Victus 2 delivers premium visuals. Snapdragon 7+ Gen 3 processor with 12GB RAM handles gaming and multitasking effortlessly. The 200MP main camera with OIS captures extraordinary detail, supported by 8MP ultra-wide and 2MP macro. Xiaomi Imaging Engine enhances low-light performance. 5000mAh battery with 120W HyperCharge reaches 100% in 19 minutes. IP68 water resistance, in-display fingerprint, dual stereo speakers with Dolby Atmos, and MIUI on HyperOS. The ultimate value flagship.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 392000, '/assets/products/redmi-note-15-pro-plus-12gb-512gb.jpg', 431200, 4.5, 1, 'Xiaomi', 1, 1),

('redmi-note-15-pro-8gb-256gb', 'Redmi Note 15 Pro 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 350000, 350000, 285000, 25, 0.21, '/assets/products/redmi-note-15-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'Redmi Note 15 Pro features a 6.67-inch 1.5K AMOLED display with 120Hz, Snapdragon 7 Gen 3 processor, and 8GB RAM. 200MP main camera with OIS, 8MP ultra-wide, 2MP macro. 5000mAh battery with 67W turbo charging. IP64 splash resistance, stereo speakers, MIUI on HyperOS. Excellent value proposition for quality-conscious buyers.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 285000, '/assets/products/redmi-note-15-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 313500, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 1, 0),

('redmi-note-15-8gb-256gb', 'Redmi Note 15 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 280000, 280000, 228000, 30, 0.20, '/assets/products/redmi-note-15-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'Redmi Note 15 is the reliable everyday champion. 6.67-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz, MediaTek Helio G100 Ultimate processor, 8GB RAM. 108MP main camera, 8MP ultra-wide, 2MP macro. 5000mAh battery with 45W fast charging. IP54, stereo speakers, microSD expansion. Trusted by millions for solid performance.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 228000, '/assets/products/redmi-note-15-8gb-256gb.jpg', 250800, 4.4, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 0),

('redmi-15c-6gb-128gb', 'Xiaomi Redmi 15C 6GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 168685, 168685, 138000, 50, 0.22, '/assets/products/redmi-15c-6gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Redmi 15C boasts a huge 6.9-inch FHD+ display with 90Hz, strong MediaTek Helio G99 processor, and massive 7000mAh battery with 18W charging. 50MP AI dual camera, 8MP selfie, AI face unlock, and side fingerprint sensor. AI-enhanced cameras and customizable MIUI interface. Excellent for multimedia, heavy daily usage, and users who prioritize battery life above all else. A true marathon runner at an incredible price.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 138000, '/assets/products/redmi-15c-6gb-128gb.jpg', 151800, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1),

('redmi-14c-4gb-128gb', 'Xiaomi Redmi 14C 4GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 135000, 135000, 110000, 45, 0.21, '/assets/products/redmi-14c-4gb-128gb.jpg', 'Redmi 14C offers incredible value with a 6.88-inch HD+ 90Hz display, MediaTek Helio G81 Ultra processor, and 4GB RAM (extendable to 8GB). 50MP AI camera, 13MP selfie with soft-light ring, 5160mAh battery with 18W USB-C charging. Side fingerprint, MIUI, and 128GB storage with microSD. Perfect for first-time smartphone buyers.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 110000, '/assets/products/redmi-14c-4gb-128gb.jpg', 121000, 4.3, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 0),

