('poco-f7-pro-12gb-512gb', 'POCO F7 Pro 12GB RAM 512GB', 'smartphones', 620000, 620000, 508000, 15, 0.21, '/assets/products/poco-f7-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 'POCO F7 Pro is the performance king with Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 processor, 12GB RAM, and 512GB UFS 4.0 storage. 6.67-inch 2K AMOLED display with 120Hz and 4000 nits. 50MP main with OIS, 50MP telephoto (2x), 12MP ultra-wide. 5000mAh battery with 120W HyperCharge. LiquidCool 4.0 with 5000mm² VC for sustained gaming. HyperOS, stereo speakers.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 508000, '/assets/products/poco-f7-pro-12gb-512gb.jpg', 558800, 4.6, 0, 'POCO', 1, 1),

('poco-x7-8gb-256gb', 'POCO X7 5G 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 380000, 380000, 310000, 30, 0.205, '/assets/products/poco-x7-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'POCO X7 5G is gaming-focused with MediaTek Dimensity 7300 Ultra, 8GB RAM, and 256GB storage. 6.67-inch 1.5K AMOLED display with 120Hz, 1920Hz PWM dimming, and Corning Gorilla Glass Victus. 50MP main with OIS, 8MP ultra-wide, 2MP macro. 5000mAh battery with 67W turbo charging. LiquidCool Technology, dual speakers, 3.5mm jack, and IP64. Favorite among mobile gamers for fluid performance and excellent cooling.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 310000, '/assets/products/poco-x7-8gb-256gb.jpg', 341000, 4.6, 1, 'POCO', 0, 1),

('poco-m7-pro-8gb-256gb', 'POCO M7 Pro 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 280000, 280000, 228000, 35, 0.20, '/assets/products/poco-m7-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'POCO M7 Pro brings premium features to the budget segment. 6.67-inch FHD+ AMOLED display with 120Hz, MediaTek Helio G100 Ultra processor, 8GB RAM. 64MP main with OIS, 8MP ultra-wide, 2MP macro. 5000mAh battery with 45W fast charging. Dual speakers, 3.5mm jack, IP64, and HyperOS. Outstanding value.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 228000, '/assets/products/poco-m7-pro-8gb-256gb.jpg', 250800, 4.5, 0, 'POCO', 0, 0),

