('xiaomi-redmi-buds-6-pro', 'Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Pro ANC', 'audio', 28000, 28000, 22500, 80, 0.048, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-buds-6-pro.jpg', 'Redmi Buds 6 Pro feature hybrid ANC up to 49dB, 11mm titanium dynamic drivers with dual-magnetic circuit, and Hi-Res Audio Wireless certification. Bluetooth 5.4, LDAC codec, 360° spatial audio with head tracking, and triple-mic AI ENC for calls. 38-hour total battery (6.5 hours earbuds ANC on). IPX5, Google Fast Pair, dual-device connection, and Xiaomi Earbuds app with customizable EQ.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22500, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-buds-6-pro.jpg', 24750, 4.6, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 1),

('xiaomi-redmi-buds-6-active', 'Xiaomi Redmi Buds 6 Active', 'audio', 9500, 9500, 7500, 120, 0.042, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-buds-6-active.jpg', 'Redmi Buds 6 Active deliver 14mm dynamic drivers, Bluetooth 5.4, and 30-hour total battery. IPX4 water resistance, touch controls, low-latency mode, and USB-C charging. Google Fast Pair and Xiaomi Earbuds app support. Exceptional value for everyday music and calls.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 7500, '/assets/products/xiaomi-redmi-buds-6-active.jpg', 8250, 4.4, 0, 'Xiaomi', 1, 0),

('xiaomi-sound-outdoor', 'Xiaomi Sound Outdoor Bluetooth Speaker 30W', 'audio', 45000, 45000, 36500, 45, 0.58, '/assets/products/xiaomi-sound-outdoor.jpg', 'Xiaomi Sound Outdoor delivers 30W of powerful audio through dual full-range drivers and dual passive radiators. IP67 waterproof and dustproof, Bluetooth 5.4 with Google Fast Pair, and 12-hour battery life. Built-in microphone, AUX input, and lanyard strap. The robust design withstands drops and outdoor conditions.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 36500, '/assets/products/xiaomi-sound-outdoor.jpg', 40150, 4.5, 0, 'Xiaomi', 0, 0),

